<div class="timeline">

<div class="timeline-item left">
<div class="content">
<h4>01. Requirement Analysis & Strategy</h4>
<p>
We analyze project requirements, business goals, and system architecture to define a comprehensive testing strategy 
that aligns with your quality objectives.
</p>
</div>
</div>

<div class="timeline-item right">
<div class="content">
<h4>02. Test Planning & Design</h4>
<p>
We create detailed test plans, test cases, and define testing methodologies to ensure complete coverage of all 
functional and non-functional requirements.
</p>
</div>
</div>

<div class="timeline-item left">
<div class="content">
<h4>03. Test Execution & Validation</h4>
<p>
We execute manual and automated tests to identify defects, performance issues, and usability concerns, ensuring 
